# A value stamped with another schema family is upcast through this family's
# hops instead of being returned at its stored version.
MODULE: UnversionedReadsStoredBodyForeignUpcast
TARGET: UnversionedReadsStoredBody
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the decoder ignores the stamp's family

--- FIND
    ELSE IF v.tag = "Raw" \/ c = NoCfg \/ v.fam # Fam \/ v.ver = c
--- REPLACE
    ELSE IF v.tag = "Raw" \/ c = NoCfg \/ v.ver = c
--- END